                                "sense_id": "1b70bb62-efbe-34a6-bdae-c1ba8c94f6be",
                                "text": "“They’re screaming, looking for taxis, calling up friends and singing Happy Birthday to each other. It’s a spectacle, a Dantesque spectacle.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
